fmrilss includes material derived from the following projects.

GLMsingle (https://github.com/cvnlab/GLMsingle)
  inst/extdata/glmsingle_hrflibrary.tsv and inst/extdata/glmsingle_basichrf.txt
  are the HRF library and canonical HRF distributed with GLMsingle. The
  algorithms in R/glmsingle*.R follow GLMsingle's published method and its
  Python implementation (commit 1ab54a65edd3ea41a6133d4b4ecb78a9c7296684).

